(
/*
SCAFFOLDING - GWDM 2.2 does not exist in schemata-2 yet.

Direction: input GWDM 2.2 -> output GWDM 2.1 (the path is output-first).

Follows the delta-transform pattern of maps/GWDM/2.1/GWDM/2.0: drop the fields
the newer version introduced, which GWDM 2.1 cannot hold. Lossy by definition -
duoCodes and dataUsePermissions have no GWDM 2.1 equivalent.

The assumed 2.2 shape, and everything still outstanding, is documented in
maps/GWDM/2.2/HDRUK/4.1.0/translation.jsonata.
*/
input ~> |$| {
  "accessibility": accessibility ~> |$| {
    /* GWDM 2.2 PLACEHOLDER - key names must match whatever the 2.2 schema defines. */
    "usage": usage ? usage ~> |$|{}, ["duoCodes", "dataUsePermissions"]| : null
  }|
}|
)
